WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.200
Narrator: Think about the last time you went to a match.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.100
Narrator: Your journey started at home - long before the gate.

3
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:12.700
Narrator: Fans plan, then travel: by metro, bus, park-and-ride shuttle, taxi or car.

4
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:18.800
Narrator: Then the Last Mile - the walk from the station or car park to the stadium.

5
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.100
Narrator: Next, the security check point, where Security screen fans and bags.

6
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.600
Narrator: Then the gate and turnstiles, the concourse, and finally the seat.

7
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:40.400
Narrator: After the final whistle, the whole journey runs backwards - with everyone leaving at once.

